"last_played": 1708538816, "avatar": "8f08130064de4051fe615295d0a079a524a24496"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome 3rd person rpg shooter with heavy inspiration on Dark Souls Design with some sprinkles of Destiny on it too. \n\nPros:\n+ Fantastic coop game\n+ Amazing and captivating graphics and atmosphere\n+ A lot of classes archetypes to choose from (many others are unlocked as you play through and unlock certain requirements)\n+ Several different gameplay options for you to make based on weapons, acessories and class combinations, with the option to use two classes at the same time.\n+ Several different stories to go through on campaign and adventure mode and also several difficulty modes to choose from\n+ Multiple dungeons, puzzles, and boss fights to go through\n+ Addictive gameplay and rich replayability\n\nCons:\n- Having to reroll the Adventure/campaign mode several times in order to get a specific dungeon/area you need as even on the right quest, you're not guaranteed to get it, forcing you to repeat the reroll process until success, which can be frustrating. This so far is the game biggest flaw, but not that detracting from fully enjoying it.\n- Can be tilting for new players or players not used to a soulslike game design\n- Very limited Character apperance customization\n- Some puzzles can be frustrating or difficult to understand forcing the player to check a guide to solve them\n- The game can be somewhat very unbalanced on it's weapons, class and acessories designs, some weapons are clearly miles ahead better than others, though it seems the game receives balance patches by developers to keep things in check\n- Coop limited to only 3 people per lobby (4 would be the ideal)\n\nGame Score: 92/100", "timestamp_created": 1708540310, "timestamp_updated": 1708540824, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}